      "illustrators": "Isuardi Therianto",
      "position": 31,
      "quantity": 3
    },
    {
      "card_id": "clone_retirement",
      "flavor": "\"They call it 'retirement'. I call it 'euthanasia'.\" -Ken \"Express\" Tenma",
      "has_xlarge": false,
      "id": "04032",
      "illustrators": "Gong Studios",
      "position": 32,
      "quantity": 3
    },
    {
      "card_id": "swordsman",
      "flavor": "Writing a program that can pass the Turing test is easy. The Gibson-Akamatsu test is a higher bar, and the only AIs to clear it thus far have been the androids. Even some humans have been known to fail.",
      "has_xlarge": false,
      "id": "04033",
      "illustrators": "Adam S. Doyle",
      "position": 33,
      "quantity": 3
    },
    {
      "card_id": "shipment_from_sansan",
      "flavor": "He signed for it, hand shaking in anticipation.",
      "has_xlarge": false,
      "id": "04034",
      "illustrators": "Agri Karuniawan",
      "position": 34,
      "quantity": 3
    },
    {
